{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_188831.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>不過也有玩家稱南方聯通也遇到這樣的問題：</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_673602.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>隨後評論區有玩家指出將DSN改114.114.114.114能暫時解決，可能就是DNS污染問題。</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_819457.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>豆包給出的解決方案：</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_264728_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_188831.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>不過也有玩家稱南方聯通也遇到這樣的問題：</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_673602.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>隨後評論區有玩家指出將DSN改114.114.114.114能暫時解決，可能就是DNS污染問題。</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_819457.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p>豆包給出的解決方案：</p>\n    <p>\n      <img src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260511/1778466147_264728_jpg_r.jpg\" alt=\"網友反映PS5北方聯通伺服器炸了 需要修改DNS\">\n    </p>\n    <p/>\n    <p/>\n    <p/>\n    <p/>\n    <p/>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-11T05:35:21.314755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":8,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}